name: roaming_partner_traffic
description: "DEMO 1 — Revenue assurance: which partner operators exchange roaming traffic, how much, and where the charges look wrong. Links fold TAP records per (visited, home, event type); width = record count, Σ CHARGE_SDR in the Working set. Look for the Aurora Telecom ← Northwind Mobile GPRS link (billed at 3.2× the agreed rate) and the Quartz↔Fjord backbone (Flow & backbone, Cut points)."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: circular
profile: telecom
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: roaming_tap_dataset
    sourceCol: SENDER_NAME
    targetCol: RECIPIENT_NAME
    linkKindCol: EVENT_TYPE
    attrCols[3]: EVENT_AT,CHARGE_SDR,SETTLEMENT_STATUS
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
